    "body": "> Can you elaborate on why URLHost would not satisfy these use cases?\r\n\r\nIt *might*... Just really not certain about the current status of `URLHost`. As I said, I'm really not all that concerned about the actual API, just the use case. I would suggest, however, that the additional object allocation with `new URLHost(...)` is not strictly needed in every case -- that is, it seems wasteful if all I really want is a simple true/false check to see if it's a valid ipv6 or not.",
